  <item>
    <title>9、叹息甄嬛传之深宫篇：紫禁城风水养人，定要让你玉减香消</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677baea2c3538295e6f2a972</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677baea2c3538295e6f2a972</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Jan 2025 10:33:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>后宫如局，众生为棋。这是我们甄嬛传系列的最后一期，这次我们不仅探讨甄嬛传里面的人物故事，更想讨论后宫悲剧的底色。</span></p><span></span><p><span>深宫似海，权力织就一座无形囚笼，情感、信仰与自由都在权力的重压下变形。等级的桎梏、厌女的困境、权力的冷酷，将人与人推向对立的深渊。女性既是制度的牺牲品，又被迫成为其中的棋子，追逐胜利，终难逃孤独与虚妄的命运。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是关于爱、权力与自由的故事，也是关于人性困境的长叹。红墙之内，千秋过尽，唯余一声叹息。</span></p><span></span><p><span>👧主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mia：小红书@niumaomao</span></p><span></span><p><span>KK ：小红书@HisunchuH</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小瀬村晶,信澤宣明 - 春夜、雨を喜ぶ - メインテーマ(春夜喜雨)</span></p><span></span><p><span>陶喆 - 讨厌红楼梦</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳Show Notes：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="118">01:58</a> Part I：甄嬛传cp线大探讨</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 对纯元菩萨的爱是皇帝的想象吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="452">07:32</a> 帝王之爱：从未真正看见自己的妃子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="563">09:23</a> 娘娘和大宫女的女性情谊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="614">10:14</a> 剪秋在颂芝飞升后给皇后梳头时心里在想什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="809">13:29</a> 正线cp果嬛的纯爱与救赎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 小四嬛cp shock到浣婢老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1173">19:33</a> 你最想看哪个角色的重生线</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1381">23:01</a> Part II：甄嬛传是一部职场爽文吗</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1825">30:25</a> 这种爽文逻辑下0个人是受益者</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2016">33:36</a> Part III：后宫剧的悲剧色彩</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a> 属于后宫的厌女与厌人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2352">39:12</a> 等级制度造就后宫的金字塔游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2456">40:56</a> 在深宫里对皇帝的爱是一种信仰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 究竟是制度把人逼疯，还是人性本恶只是披着制度的外衣</span></p><span></span><p><span>📻 收听方式：</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客/小宇宙/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐 /QQ音乐/荔枝 fm</span></p>]]></description>
