  <item>
    <title>7、瞬间心动&amp;持续崩溃：我们好像无法再恋爱了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bc2687db5e6d6bf9273099</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66bc2687db5e6d6bf9273099</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Aug 2024 03:37:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>七夕特辑｜随着女性自我意识的觉醒，爱情好像变成了都市传说，谁能真正触及爱情，又是谁可望不可及。我们在这场游戏里深陷，抽离，犹疑，徘徊。在女性的生活里，爱情究竟是精神鸦片，还是世纪末的无聊消遣呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>👧主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mia：小红书@niumaomao</span></p><span></span><p><span>KK ：小红书@HisunchuH</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>蔡依林,安室奈美惠 -l'm not yours (feat.安室奈美惠)</span></p><span></span><p><span>蔡依林,周汤豪-大丈夫</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈星翰,蔡依林-戀我癖 Feat.Jolin Tsai 蔡依林</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hea2t-春日心动日记</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳Show Notes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 曾经的恋爱狂说自己八百年没恋爱，那我呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="118">01:58</a> 恋爱女王为何开始断档？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a> 迄今为止已出土多具前男友化石</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="221">03:41</a> 虽然没谈恋爱，但震惊我多年的普信男</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="244">04:04</a> 撒谎成性的男性&amp;被迫当三的女性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">05:48</a> 渣男既要又要现场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="376">06:16</a> “我需要别人逼我一把，不如我们doi吧”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="503">08:23</a> 倒打一耙之我都为你分手了，你还不和我在一起吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="606">10:06</a> 道德绑架困境中的女性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="649">10:49</a> 宇宙最大ego男强势来袭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="692">11:32</a> 男性被拒绝之后狂暴发言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="707">11:47</a> “如果你知道孩子的父亲是谁…”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="788">13:08</a> KK全文背诵高质量男性名言警句</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a> 男性个体行为造成群体刻板印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> Crush是美好瞬间不是个体性缘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="929">15:29</a> 同频的瞬间总是令人心跳加速</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1247">20:47</a> 浪漫的开端和伤感的结局：你和我在一起那天晚上的心跳总不是假的吧？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1292">21:32</a> 笨拙的可爱：吃生肉挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1368">22:48</a> 我的鬼怪永远只看到第六集</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> 后来我好像再也没听过月亮代表我的心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1679">27:59</a> 乙女游戏很能反映择偶观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1787">29:47</a> To 齐司礼：我的世界欢迎你来到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1907">31:47</a> Mia英文名的来源—Lalaland的美好爱情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2017">33:37</a> 陈哲远真香场景之你成功吸引了我的注意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2085">34:45</a> 王俊凯泡脚桶名场面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2191">36:31</a> 话多的Alpha男离开我的世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2251">37:31</a> 全红婵：“我不想知道”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2262">37:42</a> Mia老师我不允许任何人忤逆你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2387">39:47</a> 为什么恋爱越来越难呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2401">40:01</a> 喜欢帅哥是我的命运</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2431">40:31</a> 男性不出现在我的生活里好像也可以</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2476">41:16</a> Crush只是恋爱的必要不充分条件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2543">42:23</a> 恋爱半生，情绪价值的来源依然是女性朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2595">43:15</a> 一辈子金牛座一辈子学不会主动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2642">44:02</a> 谁让喜欢的男性特质在现实中都属于幻想！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2666">44:26</a> 女性意识的崛起&amp;自我感受的排序升级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2866">47:46</a> 女王90 Ego-holic纯享版</span></p><span></span><p><span>📻 收听方式：</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客/小宇宙/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐 /QQ音乐/荔枝 fm</span></p>]]></description>
