    <title>6、共感甄嬛传之悲情篇：嬛嬛，聊完这期朕又emo啦！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b0f90433ddcbb53c8428f5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b0f90433ddcbb53c8428f5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Aug 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>叮！甄嬛传系列又更新啦，本期是悲伤逆流成河的一期节目。甄嬛传中有太多令人动容，令人唏嘘，或令人落泪的情节，令主播们久久不能忘怀。诺大的皇宫，至上的皇权，压抑的情感，让“紫禁城风水养人，定不会叫你玉减香消”成为最戏谑的笑话。那么这次，让我们一起走进这些令人触动的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>👧主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mia：小红书@niumaomao</span></p><span></span><p><span>KK ：小红书@HisunchuH</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>长相思（钢琴版）</span></p><span></span><p><span>湘妃怨（古琴独奏）</span></p><span></span><p><span>je me souviens (rae)-Jordan Critz</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳Show Notes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a> 层层递进的三次惩罚磨灭了嬛嬛心中的最后一束光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 失权在后宫竟如此寸步难行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 谁能不为眉姐姐去世落泪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">03:19</a> 浣碧之死：从前的甄嬛彻底消失</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a> 熹妃回宫是主动选择被驯服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 主播对甄嬛并非指责，是大大的心疼！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="699">11:39</a> 对的时间遇到对的人，苏培盛是唯一真男人！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="776">12:56</a> 如果孟静娴活着，果子狸最终会移情别恋吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="846">14:06</a> 宜修被废：这吃人的后宫里没有一个女人能好过</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1042">17:22</a> 其实宜修很懂皇帝，帝后共享一片黑暗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1179">19:39</a> 狠心皇帝难得的真情时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1468">24:28</a> 犀利一问：皇帝原谅甄嬛动人的缘由是性别还是权力？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> 四郎对嬛嬛的怀疑如何生根发芽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">27:11</a> 皇帝原谅甄嬛：不会手下留情的人，却在心里留了情</span></p><span></span><p><span>📻 收听方式：</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客/小宇宙/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐 /QQ音乐</span></p>]]></description>
