  <item>
    <title>5、一起桃花坞S4：旷野还是轨道？都不如共同经历的人重要</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a4e9767349f7a557ec7b0b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a4e9767349f7a557ec7b0b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 27 Jul 2024 12:35:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>随着桃花坞第四季生活实验的开展，旷野和轨道这两种生活方式再次回归我们的视线。人生是否除了轨道就是旷野？旷野和轨道又代表着怎样的人生？我们在观察别人的生活模式时在关注什么？人生道路的选择背后依然是人与人的链接吗？让我们走进桃花坞第四季，试着解答心中的疑问。</span></p><span></span><p><span>👧主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mia：小红书@niumaomao</span></p><span></span><p><span>KK ：小红书@HisunchuH</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hea2t - 春日心动日记</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jasper,Martin Arteta,<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">11:11</a> Music Group - Past Lives</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳Show Notes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a> 桃花坞引发的旷野&amp;轨道探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="134">02:14</a> 原来我们都陷入了信息茧房</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="162">02:42</a> 对旷野和轨道的预设和想象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="226">03:46</a> 轨道最初的现实设定—社会保障制度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">05:16</a> 桃花坞的轨道是一种美化吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="371">06:11</a> 轨道小组的氛围消解痛苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="465">07:45</a> 轨道的痛苦是一种刻板印象？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="537">08:57</a> 拜托！旷野也不是野人吧！？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a> 离职的gap期属于旷野吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="669">11:09</a> 做自己想做的事情就是旷野啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="689">11:29</a> 轨道组team work的魅力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="784">13:04</a> 节目组制造的旷野轨道强对比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a> 录播客是自己选择的旷野</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="917">15:17</a> 离职后依然无法离开轨道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a> 我的人生需要轨道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="943">15:43</a> 旷野轨道实则非二元</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="964">16:04</a> kk与自己的不松弛自洽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1074">17:54</a> 花少三非洲大陆—mia的梦中之地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 非洲入境困境—预防疾病</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1152">19:12</a> 陈柏霖的旷野：一人一狗的流放</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1189">19:49</a> 王鹤棣的松弛像呼吸一样简单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1261">21:01</a> mia来澳洲之后的松弛同化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1301">21:41</a> 有时间限制的荒岛生活也是美好回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1353">22:33</a> kk更喜欢第二季的模式—可选择的旷野生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1404">23:24</a> 王传君天生属于旷野</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1463">24:23</a> 秩序感代表—张新成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1564">26:04</a> mia总是害怕别人的眼光而没法做自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1626">27:06</a> 轨道组离不开辣目洋子！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1656">27:36</a> 处女座天生吸引金牛座</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1705">28:25</a> 仁科引发的mbti乱谈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1788">29:48</a> 农村拓哉硬控关谷神奇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1808">30:08</a> 你成为不了他，因为他不会想成为任何人</span></p><span></span><p><span>📻 收听方式：</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客/小宇宙/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐 /QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>每周五 or 周六晚不定时更新</span></p>]]></description>
