  <item>
    <title>4、细品甄嬛传之爆笑篇：想问 God问编剧，这些情节合理吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669bb7f137236c546e832201</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669bb7f137236c546e832201</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 Jul 2024 13:13:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>拜托，怎么经典也有咁多离谱之处啊！？这期主播开喷后宫离谱行为，开启经典桥段模仿秀（仅供娱乐），嘉宾更是共感甄嬛十分钟，上演《世界上的另一个我》。这些幽默情节的背后究竟是编剧的疏漏，还是人设的要求呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>👧主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mia：小红书@niumaomao</span></p><span></span><p><span>KK ：小红书@HisunchuH</span></p><span></span><p><span>👻嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>非洲浣婢—八条</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>采莲—姚贝娜</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rachel Currea—Abundance of the heart</span></p><span></span><p><span>长相思（电视剧《甄嬛传》背景音乐）</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳Show Notes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> &nbsp;周宁海变身华妃军师？娘娘您是怎么想的？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 嬛嬛蝴蝶表演：路人围观贡献精彩reaction</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> 甄嬛老师的“三段式”表演，建议收录教科书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a> “血滴子”用处何在？结尾竟被小允子一板砖拍死</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> 安陵容变身AI，测量式报出香料成分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="613">10:13</a> 太后的科研成果欢宜香能否被AI小鸟识破？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="728">12:08</a> &nbsp;安陵容是甄嬛传的补位歌手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="824">13:44</a> &nbsp;鸟是资源咖爱豆，每次强势回归又默默flop</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">16:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;于无人处苦练冰嬉，整个后宫都是表演型人格？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1113">18:33</a> &nbsp;年世兰又失了神志？她研制的药方你敢用吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> &nbsp;智商世袭：年世兰&amp;年羹尧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> &nbsp;富察第一定律——数理化思维解构宫斗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1448">24:08</a> &nbsp;滴血验亲苏妃助力：温大人和槿汐怎么会是奴才的孩子？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1606">26:46</a> &nbsp;浣婢老师：果郡王？超雄？不认可！不喜欢！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1858">30:58</a> &nbsp;尝试理解：也许舒妃认可是果嬛恩爱的闭环…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1988">33:08</a> &nbsp;大辩论：甄嬛在甘露寺毫不反抗疑似人设崩塌？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2423">40:23</a> &nbsp;甄嬛离宫：带走长相思，是带走了我对你的心</span></p><span></span><p><span>📻 收听方式：</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客/小宇宙/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐 /QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>每周五 or 周六晚不定时更新</span></p>]]></description>
