  <item>
    <title>3、辣评甄嬛传之人物篇：三人站队后宫娘娘，竟因年世兰大打出手？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6692693a37236c546ee0cc1d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6692693a37236c546ee0cc1d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 13 Jul 2024 11:47:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>距甄嬛传播出已有十四年之久，但相关的分析依然层出不穷，CP向剪辑视频更是花样百出，这些二创作品的产出都得益于本剧优秀的群像刻画，复杂立体的人物形象也造就了剧情的丰满与深度，这次我们携“甄学家”非洲浣婢老师一起辣评甄嬛传人物：让我们再次走近你，陪我长大的角色们～</span></p><span></span><p><span>👧主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mia：小红书@niumaomao</span></p><span></span><p><span>KK ：小红书@HisunchuH</span></p><span></span><p><span>👻嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>非洲浣婢—八条</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>裴去病 - 红颜劫／菩萨蛮 伴奏（甄嬛传）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小瀬村晶 - 春の光、夏の風 (Piano Version)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Schuwenn Z.钢琴作曲 - 《甄嬛传》片尾曲《凤凰于飞》钢琴独奏版</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳Show Notes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> &nbsp;浣婢空降？欢迎新嘉宾到来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;甄嬛传人物大解析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="99">01:39</a> &nbsp;太后为家族荣耀在后宫“装瞎”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> &nbsp;甄嬛后期成为太后也会模板化吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a> &nbsp;世兰不拿雍正当皇帝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="307">05:07</a> &nbsp;皇帝故意纵着世兰—帝王之术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">06:02</a> &nbsp;对皇帝的清醒是一种女主光环吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="439">07:19</a> &nbsp;安陵容对皇帝有过爱吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="551">09:11</a> &nbsp;安陵容技能点max，贵人运无敌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">10:22</a> &nbsp;鸟粉大反驳：陵容也是聪慧的小女孩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a> &nbsp;小鸟令人唏嘘的事业之路—我真的不想再当“玩意儿”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="842">14:02</a> &nbsp;鸟嬛脱颖而出的原因—你是我生命中的第一束光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1014">16:54</a> &nbsp;小鸟和两位“贵人”的关系起点并不一致</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">19:08</a> &nbsp;皇后与甄嬛的关系为何变质？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1248">20:48</a> &nbsp;不理解世兰的物欲重，与争宠事业背道而驰？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1453">24:13</a> &nbsp;世兰的目标是始终如一的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1597">26:37</a> &nbsp;一边画画一边狂练铁砂掌，世兰为何那样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1640">27:20</a> &nbsp;皇帝向世兰错误行为持续输出正反馈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a> &nbsp;非洲浣婢老师称号来源？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1798">29:58</a> &nbsp;浣碧第一视角行为解析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1955">32:35</a> &nbsp;碧姐是真情版得道多助版安陵容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2167">36:07</a> &nbsp;嫁给果子狸是浣碧设的局吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2307">38:27</a> &nbsp;浣碧的忠诚指数起伏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2417">40:17</a> &nbsp;如果选甄嬛传中的人物一起搞事业，你会选谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2471">41:11</a> &nbsp;眉嬛对比大分析—我的cp是真的！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2602">43:22</a> &nbsp;眉在情感方面比嬛更果断吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2713">45:13</a> &nbsp;眉嬛对皇帝失望的点：原来你从来不曾懂过我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2773">46:13</a> &nbsp;眉粉狂夸：完全不厌女的女性形象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2831">47:11</a> &nbsp;眉姐姐放弃皇帝与她端庄的性格矛盾吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2960">49:20</a> &nbsp;突然不定时更新的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span>📻 收听方式：</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客/小宇宙/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐 /QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>每周五 or 周六晚不定时更新</span></p>]]></description>
